Cohere v2 goldens generated against the Cohere Chat API v2 surface
(https://api.cohere.com/v2) and the v3 embed / v1 rerank endpoints.

These inputs are NOT generated by running LiteLLM (see plan §14). They
encode the documented Cohere wire format. Divergences from LiteLLM's
Python transforms are intentional where LiteLLM is known to be buggy;
the provider's official docs are authoritative.
